.Dd November 2, 2026
.Dt AKTURE-CONV 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm akture-conv
.Nd convert a picture into an akture background
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl s Ar W Ns x Ns Ar H
.Op Fl m Cm fill | fit | center
.Op Fl b Ar radius
.Op Fl d Ar percent
.Op Fl c Ar #RRGGBB
.Fl o Ar output.akbg
.Ar input
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
converts a PNG or JPEG picture into the
.Pa .akbg
format shown by
.Xr akture-greeter 8 :
a 32 byte header followed by BGRX pixels that need no further
processing.
The output size must be given; the screen is never queried.
Files are named
.Ar name Ns - Ns Ar W Ns x Ns Ar H Ns .akbg
and placed in
.Pa /usr/share/akture/backgrounds .
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl s Ar W Ns x Ns Ar H
Size of the output, at most 16384 on each side.
.It Fl m Ar mode
How a picture of another aspect ratio is fitted:
.Cm fill
covers the output and crops the excess (the default),
.Cm fit
fits the picture inside and pads with the colour of
.Fl c ,
.Cm center
does not scale at all.
.It Fl b Ar radius
Blur with this radius in output pixels.
.It Fl d Ar percent
Darken by up to this amount.
The full amount is applied at the top and bottom edges, fading to
40% of it in the middle, which gives the faint shadows behind the
clock and the login controls.
.It Fl c Ar #RRGGBB
Colour for padding and for transparent parts of PNG pictures;
black by default.
.It Fl o Ar output.akbg
Output file.
It is written under a temporary name and renamed into place.
.El
.Pp
Scaling and blurring are done in linear light, so that reduced
pictures do not darken.
The EXIF orientation of JPEG pictures is applied.
Grey, palette, 16-bit and transparent PNG pictures are converted to
8-bit RGB.
.Sh SECURITY CONSIDERATIONS
Pictures are decoded in a child process.
When run as root, the child drops to the user
.Dq _akture
first, and only sends the resulting pixels back over a pipe.
Pictures larger than 16384 pixels on a side or 64 million pixels in
total are refused before they are decoded.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
akture-conv -s 1366x768 -d 35 \e
    -o /usr/share/akture/backgrounds/autumn-1366x768.akbg autumn.jpg
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr akture.conf 5 ,
.Xr akture-greeter 8
